## CLI 命令速查

```bash
CLI=~/ssd/temp/projects/AI/AiMemory/backend/cli.py

python3 $CLI working
python3 $CLI remember --type <episodic|semantic|procedural> --summary "简短标签" --content "详细内容" --tags "标签1,标签2"
python3 $CLI recall --query "关键词" --tags "标签"
python3 $CLI update --id <ID> --content "新内容" --append
python3 $CLI update --id <ID> --entities "实体1,实体2"
python3 $CLI update --id <ID> --entities "新增实体" --append-entities
python3 $CLI update --id <ID> --tags "新标签" --append-tags
python3 $CLI rebuild-graph --dry-run
```

